{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2022-12-22 12:57:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE RECOGNIZED BY S&P DOW JONES INDICES & CDP FOR ITS SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDICES FOR THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, AS WELL AS TO CDP'S CLIMATE CHANGE AND WATER SECURITY A LISTS FOR THE THIRD YEAR RUNNING. THESE ACHIEVEMENTS RECOGNIZE COLGATE'S ONGOING COMMITMENT TO SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP, SUSTAINABLE BUSINESS PRACTICES AND TRANSPARENCY ABOUT ITS SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS."}